  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ret 308.07 Election By Eligible Employee's Estate. An election made pursuant to Ret 308.06 shall be made in writing and filed with NHRS on or before the eligible employee's current installment payment due date or 90 days from the date of the eligible employee's death, whichever date is later.\n\nSource. #5324, eff 2-5-92 (from Ret 307.04), EXPIRED: 2-5-98\n\nNew. #7375, INTERIM, eff 10-13-00, EXPIRES: 4-11-01; ss by #7478, eff 4-10-01; ss by #7573, eff 10-10-01, EXPIRED: 10-10-09\n\nNew. #9562, eff 10-14-09, EXPIRED: 10-14-17\n\nNew. #12511, INTERIM, eff 4-11-18, EXPIRED: 10-8-18\n\nNew. #12707, eff 1-9-19",
